    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compute named Hofstadter-like recurrences for long ranges and measure fluctuation spectra, predictability, compression, and departure from simple periodic or nested baselines. Robust examples using only addition and subtraction establish the existential capability claim.";
